<title>CANADA: Centrefund buys three shopping centers.</title>
<headline>Centrefund buys three shopping centers.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centrefund Realty Corp on Thursday said it completed the acquisition of three shopping malls in separate transactions valued at about C$42 million.</p>
</text>
